      "id": "AS-PRM-LL-TEST-MODE",
      "kind": "param",
      "overrides": "PRM-LL-TEST-MODE",
      "textKey": "rule.as.ll.test_mode",
      "condition": true,
      "output": {
        "value": {
          "onlineAvailable": true,
          "where": ["home_online", "rto"]
        }
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "In Assam the LL test can be taken online at home with Aadhaar face authentication, or at the RTO.",
        "hi": "Assam में लर्नर लाइसेंस टेस्ट आधार फेस ऑथेंटिकेशन के साथ घर से ऑनलाइन, या RTO पर दिया जा सकता है।"
      },
      "source": {
        "title": "Assam: learner's licence test mode",
